{"book":"galatians","num":6,"verses":[{"en":"Brethren, if a man be overtaken in a fault, ye which are spiritual, restore such an one in the spirit of meekness; considering thyself, lest thou also be tempted.","n":1,"sm":"Le au uso e, afai e maua se tagata i se tasi agasala, o outou o i la le Agaga, ia outou faafoi mai le ua faapeaina ma le loto o le agamalu. Ia faaeteete foi oe ina ne'i faaosoosoina oe.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Le"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"uso"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"afai"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"maua"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"tasi"},{"en":"","sm":"agasala,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Agaga,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"faafoi"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faapeaina"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"loto"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"agamalu."},{"en":"","sm":"Ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faaeteete"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"oe"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ne'i"},{"en":"","sm":"faaosoosoina"},{"en":"","sm":"oe."}]},{"en":"Bear ye one another's burdens, and so fulfil the law of Christ.","n":2,"sm":"la outou fesui i a outou avega e ave, ma ia faapea ona outou faia le tulafono a Keriso.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"fesui"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"avega"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ave,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tulafono"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"Keriso."}]},{"en":"For if a man think himself to be something, when he is nothing, he deceiveth himself.","n":3,"sm":"Aua p